gy before her \u2018accident\u2019 and possibly becoming one of the bound .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T14:38:55-08:00","id":1288083,"title":"","content":"Here\u2019s a reddit commet from the Whitewolf subreddit \u201cI think that the books in their rooms are good clues as to which Hunter Conspiracy) each player belongs to.<br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> Rose is part of The Scroll of the Aegis Kai Doru, and she writes a walkthrough for all the players through her adventures while leaning on magic and her magic wand artifacts.<br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> Jade speaks to her dead stuffed grandfather before the game begins, dead Feferi during her session, and then creates Jadesprite out of a dead version of herself and later speaks to dead versions of the players in dream bubbles and the 'dead' (exiled) spirit of Calliope, so she seems to be part of the Les Myst\u00e8res) conspiracy (the unfocused and eclectic one), on the path of the beast (which is how she merged with Bec). She could also arguably belong to the Ascended Ones because she talks with her denizen instead of just attacking it, utilizing diplomacy and negotiation to achieve her aims in that specific instance.<br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> As you mention, Dave is born of evil. His brother abused him emotionally and he was in the presence of 'Lil Cal's demonic influence growing up, and he seeks to use the evil of his upbringing to now protect his friends and save the universe, just as the Lucifuge do.<br /> <br /> He could also arguably be a Knight of St. Adrian because he is motivated by 